Subject: [PATCH] Reject conflicting clients for an already pinned shpool
 session

Compare the complete original locator at creation, metadata restoration and kill boundaries, retaining socket-only comparison solely for shared-daemon ownership. A new regression rejects a replacement client on the same socket without attachment, kill, or cache mutation.
